{"book":"kinney","chapter":"react-typescript","chapterTitle":"React مع TypeScript","slug":"tailwind-cva-typed-variants","title":"متغيّرات Tailwind المكتوبة (Typed) باستخدام CVA","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"النمط-الأساسي","text":"النمط الأساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"slots-والتعدد-polymorphism","text":"Slots والتعدّد (Polymorphism)"},{"depth":2,"id":"المتغيرات-المركبة-compound-variants-والصرامة","text":"المتغيّرات المركّبة (Compound Variants) والصرامة"},{"depth":2,"id":"نمط-slots-للأصناف","text":"نمط Slots للأصناف"}],"html":"<p>اقترن Tailwind بـ <code>class-variance-authority</code> (CVA) لإنشاء واجهات متغيّرات (variants) قابلة للاكتشاف وآمنة الأنواع — لا مزيد من «حساء» الأصناف stringly-typed.</p>\n<h2 id=\"النمط-الأساسي\">النمط الأساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { cva, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">VariantProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-variance-authority&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> button = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md font-medium&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variants</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">primary</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bg-blue-600 text-white&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ghost</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hover:bg-gray-100&#x27;</span> },\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">sm</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;h-8 px-3&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">md</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;h-10 px-4&#x27;</span> },\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">compoundVariants</span>: [{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;primary&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;md&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;shadow&#x27;</span> }],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultVariants</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;primary&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;md&#x27;</span> },\n});\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonVariants</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">VariantProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> button&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Button</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{\n  variant,\n  size,\n  className,\n  ...rest\n}: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonVariants</span> &amp; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonHTMLAttributes</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLButtonElement</span>&gt;</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{button({</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span> })} {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...rest</span>} /&gt;</span></span>;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"slots-والتعدد-polymorphism\">Slots والتعدّد (Polymorphism)</h2>\n<p>استخدم CVA لكل slot وprop <code>as</code> متعدّد الأشكال (polymorphic) مع generics مقيدة للحفاظ على refs والخصائص مكتوبة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { forwardRef, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ElementType</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentPropsWithRef</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> card = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;rounded-lg border bg-white&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variants</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">elevated</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">true</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;shadow-md&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">false</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> } },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultVariants</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">elevated</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> },\n});\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CardVariants</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">VariantProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> card&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PolymorphicProps</span>&lt;C <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ElementType</span>, P&gt; = P &amp; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span>?: C;\n} &amp; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Omit</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentPropsWithRef</span>&lt;C&gt;, keyof P | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;as&#x27;</span>&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Card</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forwardRef</span>(\n  &lt;C <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ElementType</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;div&#x27;</span>&gt;<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">\n    { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span>, elevated, className, ...rest }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PolymorphicProps</span>&lt;C, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CardVariants</span>&gt;,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ref</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Element</span>&gt;,\n  </span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Comp</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> ?? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;div&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> C;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Comp</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{ref</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">any</span>} <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{card({</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">elevated</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span> })} {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...rest</span>} /&gt;</span></span>;\n  },\n);\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"المتغيرات-المركبة-compound-variants-والصرامة\">المتغيّرات المركّبة (Compound Variants) والصرامة</h2>\n<p>عرّف حالات متبادلة الاستبعاد أو مجمّعة مع أمان at compile-time.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> badge = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;inline-flex items-center rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variants</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">color</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">gray</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bg-gray-100 text-gray-800&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">red</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bg-red-100 text-red-800&#x27;</span> },\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">tone</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">solid</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">outline</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bg-transparent ring-1&#x27;</span> },\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">compoundVariants</span>: [{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;red&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">tone</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;outline&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ring-red-300&#x27;</span> }],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultVariants</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;gray&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">tone</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;solid&#x27;</span> },\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"نمط-slots-للأصناف\">نمط Slots للأصناف</h2>\n<p>استخدم record من CVAs لمكوّنات متعدّدة الأجزاء (مثل <code>input</code>، <code>label</code>، <code>helper</code>).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputSlots = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">root</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;grid gap-1&#x27;</span>),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">label</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;text-sm font-medium&#x27;</span>),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">input</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;rounded border px-3 py-2 focus:outline-none focus:ring&#x27;</span>),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">helper</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;text-xs text-gray-500&#x27;</span>),\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InputProps</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">label</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">helper</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n} &amp; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">React</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">InputHTMLAttributes</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span>&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Input</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ label, helper, className, ...rest }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InputProps</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{inputSlots.root()}</span>&gt;</span>\n      {label &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{inputSlots.label()}</span>&gt;</span>{label}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>}\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{inputSlots.input({</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span> })} {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...rest</span>} /&gt;</span>\n      {helper &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{inputSlots.helper()}</span>&gt;</span>{helper}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>}\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  );\n}\n</code></pre>\n"}